<title>SINGAPORE: Mobil Australia restarts refining units at Altona.</title>
<headline>Mobil Australia restarts refining units at Altona.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mobil Australia has restarted its Altona refining units from annual maintenance shutdown on Sunday, a company source said on Monday.</p>
<p>Mobil had shut down its 55,000 barrel-per-day (bpd) crude distillation unit (CDU) No.3 and three reformers with a total capacity of 31,500 bpd on May 27.</p>
<p>The CDU at the 115,000 bpd refinery is expected to resume full capacity by late Monday, the source said.</p>
<p>Singapore Newsroom (+65 870 3571)</p>
</text>
